Package: InterTransViewer
Type: Package
Title: Compare Differential Expression Profiles Across Experiments
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "A. V.", family = "Tyapkin", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "141709462+al-t1@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Describes and compares differential gene expression profiles
    from several experiments, as proposed in Tyapkin et al. (2023)
    <doi:10.18699/VJGB-23-119>. Computes the number of differentially
    expressed genes (DEGs) per experiment, the fraction of
    experiment-specific DEGs, the R metric, the pairwise similarity of DEG
    lists, hierarchical clustering of experiments with bootstrap clade
    support, and a bootstrap test of the homogeneity of a set of
    experiments. Uses base R only.
